msgstr "关闭后,此会话不显示 SFTP 侧栏。"

msgid "Enable shell integration"
msgstr "启用 Shell 集成"

msgid "When on, probes for bash/zsh via a separate exec channel and injects prompt hooks (directory follow and command capture). Leave off for switches/routers or unsupported shells."
msgstr "开启后会通过独立 exec 通道探测 bash/zsh，并注入提示符钩子(目录跟随与命令捕获)。交换机/路由器或不支持的 shell 请保持关闭。"

